## (query)
[Sp]lit clip                                 [S]              qrec clip split
[S]eek to [p]revious frame                   [←]              qrec seek --by -1f
[S]eek to [p]revious edit point              [↑]              qrec seek --edit prev
[S]eek to next edit [p]oint                  [↓]              qrec seek --edit next
[S]elect [p]revious clip                     [,]              —
[S]ave frame as [P]NG                        [P]              qrec frame save
[S]witch Live / [P]rogram                    [Tab]            —
Trim [s]tart to [p]layhead                   [[]              qrec clip trim --start
Autocut [s]ettings and [p]review             [Shift][C]       qrec autocut --dry-run
[S]huttle sto[p]                             [K]              —
[S]elect next cli[p]                         [.]              —
Toggle [s]na[p]ping                          [N]              —
Focu[s] [p]revious region                    [Shift][F6]      —
